{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02724","headline":"和杨舍人咏中书省花树 · 张文琮","name":"和杨舍人咏中书省花树","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"花萼映芳丛，参差间早红。\n因风时落砌，杂雨乍浮空。\n影照凤池水，香飘鸡树风。\n岂不爱攀折，希君怀袖中。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张文琮","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_02724.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02724","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}